  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s On Duty Performance Polo is specially designed for public safety professionals in the field with a lightweight yet durable composition and a variety of tactical features, including gusseted sleeves, mic tabs, and more.&nbsp;</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133117",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s On Duty Performance Polo is a comfortable and functional uniform shirt for first responders and public safety. The polo shirt features Raglan style gusseted sleeves that enable enhanced mobility on-the-job. A soft ribbed knit collar features collar stays that help the polo t shirt maintain its shape for long-term use. Mic tabs on each shoulder and on the three-button placket provide multiple mic placement options on the tactical shirt, while two pen pockets on the left sleeve make the tactical t shirt perfect for first responders and public safety. This long-lasting polo shirt features a comfortable and durable moisture wicking composition so that you can wear it all day.</p>",
